   Q('mcq', 'Why is blended fabric difficult to recycle?', 'C', "it's very difficult to separate them at the end of the garment's life", 'The fibres cannot easily be separated.', opts=['It contains chemicals from dyeing.', 'It wears out too quickly.', 'The fibres in it cannot easily be separated.']),
